Task 1 :- Given tables students(id, name, age) and marks(student_id, subject, score) ,
write SQL queries for: List all students older than 20 Get the average score per student
Get the topper (highest total score) List students who have no marks recorded.

ANS ->  CREATE TABLE students(
        stud_id int PRIMARY KEY,
        stud_name varchar(50),
        stud_age int,
);
        CREATE TABLE marks(
        marks_Id int PRIMARY KEY,
        stud_id int,
        stud_subject varchar(50),
        stud_score int,
        FOREIGN KEY (stud_id) REFERENCE students(stud_id)
        );

